odric-master-tactician-2012-06-26#:~:text=Something%20about%20her%20attracted,a%20trap%20near%20there.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Odric, Master Tactician\" by Jenna Helland. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 26 Jun 2012."}},{"id":"odric-master-tactician-2012-06-26-e6","era":null,"summary":"At midnight Odric and Grete lie in wait by a witchbane's orb baited with the widow's blood, and Odric recalls that her corpse showed no sign of werewolf violence.","participants":["odric","grete","witchbane-s-orb","widow-of-bitterheart-hill"],"location":"torbach","importance":"minor","page":"stories/odric-master-tactician-2012-06-26","order":357,"story_date":"2012-06-26","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":33,"quote":"There was no evidence she'd been killed by a werewolf attack","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/odric-master-tactician-2012-06-26#:~:text=There%20was%20no%20evidence,by%20a%20werewolf%20attack","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Odric, Master Tactician","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Jenna Helland"],"date":"2012-06-26","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/odric-master-tactician-2012-06-26","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/odric-master-tactician-2012-06-26#:~:text=There%20was%20no%20evidence,by%20a%20werewolf%20attack","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Odric, Master Tactician\" by Jenna Helland. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 26 Jun 2012."}},{"id":"odric-master-tactician-2012-06-26-e7","era":null,"summary":"A tall shadow enters the clearing, and cathars drop a heavy net on the creature.","participants":["odric","cathars"],"location":"torbach","importance":"major","page":"stories/odric-master-tactician-2012-06-26","order":357,"story_date":"2012-06-26","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":37,"quote":"Odric shouted to the cathars in the treetops, who cast down the heavy net","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/